Rāvaṇa praises Indrajit weapons and sends him --- Indrajit rides divine chariot to Hanumān --- Indrajit and Hanumān duel without finding opening --- Indrajit binds Hanumān with Brahmā weapon --- Hanumān honors Brahmā boon and accepts capture --- Hanumān lets rākṣasas add bark bonds freeing Brahmāstra --- Indrajit worries but drags Hanumān to Rāvaṇa --- Rākṣasas debate killing monkey as Hanumān views palace --- Hanumān sees blazing Rāvaṇa and declares monkey embassy